        "purpose": "DOM paper fan/tilt and scene changes. No WebGL, homeLens, model download or idle render loop; reduced motion and no JavaScript expose normal document flow. V19 home-only canvas follows smooth scroll progress: light #ffffff to #f2eadc; dark #09090b to #211e19. Body/stage/close share the surface; return to top and static fallbacks reset it. Theme remapping is CSS-only."
